<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-085" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">尚書令<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0003" ref="591_360_8ca">樂廣</persName><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0005" ref="591_360_8ca_D">女</persName>為<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0007" ref="e81_f09_000">成都王</persName>妃，或譖諸太尉<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0017" ref="4c6_984_9ed">乂</persName>；<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0019" ref="4c6_984_9ed">乂</persName>以問<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0022" ref="591_360_8ca">廣</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0024" ref="591_360_8ca">廣</persName>神色不動，徐曰：「<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0034" ref="591_360_8ca">廣</persName>豈以五男易一女哉！」<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:accusation:m0045" ref="4c6_984_9ed">乂</persName>猶疑之。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:obituary" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">春，正月，丙午，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-085-jin043-leguang:obituary:m0008" ref="591_360_8ca">樂廣</persName>以憂卒。</p>
</text>
